{"step_index":43,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T19:52:57Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-22T01:22:57+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-22T01:23:08+05:30\nThe search for \"Qwen 2.5 coder 3B abliterated OR Phi-4 mini abliterated OR Gemma 4 abliterated uncensored huggingface model\" returned the following summary:\nFor the models you mentioned, there are several \"abliterated\" (uncensored) versions available on Hugging Face. These models have undergone weight-editing processes to remove the internal \"refusal\" directions typically present in instruction-tuned LLMs.\n\n### **Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Abliterated**\nThere are multiple versions and formats of this model available, often maintained by community members:\n*   **Hugging Face Search:** You can find various implementations by searching for `Qwen2.5-Coder-3B-Instruct-abliterated`[1][2][3].\n*   **Formats:** Versions exist in **GGUF** (for local CPU/GPU inference via `llama.cpp`)[4][1][3], **EXL2**[2], and even **MNN** for on-device mobile deployment[5].\n*   **Creator/Source:** Notable contributors include `bartowski`[4], `criscar22`[1], and `huihui-ai`[2][6].\n\n### **Phi-4 Mini Abliterated**\nBecause Phi-4-mini has a specific architecture that can make standard abliteration difficult (often requiring a \"layer sweep\" to locate the refusal crystallization point), specialized versions have been developed:\n*   **Hugging Face:** Search for `Phi-4-Mini-Abliterated`[7][8].\n*   **Key Repositories:**\n    *   `DuoNeural/Phi-4-Mini-Abliterated`[7]\n    *   `huihui-ai/Phi-4-mini-reasoning-abliterated`[9]\n    *   Various GGUF quantizations are also available from community uploaders[10][8][11].\n\n### **Gemma 4 Abliterated**\nGemma 4 models (including the 12B and larger variants) have several abliterated/uncensored versions. Because these are multimodal models, some versions are specifically noted for preserving vision/audio capabilities alongside the text-based abliteration[12][13][14].\n*   **Hugging Face:** Look for `gemma-4-*-abliterated-uncensored`[12][15].\n*   **Key Repositories:**\n    *   `aoiandroid/gemma-4-12B-it-abliterated-uncensored`[12]\n    *   `mradermacher` provides widespread GGUF support for these models[15].\n    *   `huihui-ai` also offers various Gemma 4 abliterated models[16][17].\n\n### **Important Considerations**\n*   **Safety Warning:** Abliterated models have had their safety filters significantly reduced[6][16][18]. They may produce controversial, sensitive, or inappropriate content. They are generally intended for research, testing, or controlled environments[6][19].\n*   **Refusal Patterns:** Some researchers note that certain models (like Gemma 4) may exhibit \"delayed refusal,\" where they provide a helpful introduction before refusing. Verify the documentation on the specific model card if you encounter unexpected behavior[14].\n*   **Verification:** Always check the \"Model Card\" on the Hugging Face page to ensure the model was abliterated using a methodology you trust (e.g., orthogonalization of the refusal direction)[19].\n\nSources:\n[1] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFEfRGhfnniSdH_rqMTJSfKJoe96nZH_TWW13_XpaxMo0Jpe393Z7h4Ol8jKLiERHaCf_uaH6lsqeYav77A87IAp_nDM3GTuiBq7nPtZDJtBqnTjQN-lAC_CXe1jkvXFhgiCVcHSqQsxto9ybPw5f_9cXQ=)\n[2] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGzexp33WrrZFBqeY77BPkeqT_Jcog6C4tAPULElVMqETx5tbIk9NfvgACuwYVJvcfov5JVfzHGyVMWRbBoIaFK_ct0t_pv1ZnD2d90gJ6R1zLaIF0KT3vi011-XNW8ZaroKagPR7PY6khI_1cPWt4ub2HBO5mK26LQS5z3Ib7nP0mNeMH2AmNGaGLYmg0llv0=)\n[3] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHsPJfg30MaceKKo8IN9BBEV9rRb0O09sJl1P9BqBA1eJsolHW45e0Phemak50QoUNNSUvlGxKXqbme4PJIpJ8crceAyVhHjpy3s_tHvvau0S6XqWpgyfb2QTP4ltejQsRsRBM7k1IhyhqnGad-cnj0XFlg0o7I5ZMBHDe7Mw==)\n[4] [huggingface.co](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQ