{"step_index":54,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T20:03:34Z","content":"Let me update the implementation plan with all the decisions locked in and get your final approval to start building.","thinking":"The user has confirmed they want to use HuggingFace Transformers with the Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Abliterated model. Now I need to update the implementation plan with this specific choice and get approval to start building.\n\nLet me update the implementation plan to reflect:\n1. Model: Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Instruct Abliterated\n2. Runtime: HuggingFace Transformers (not Ollama)\n3. All the architecture decisions we've discussed\n\nThen I should ask for approval before building.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":true,"Summary":"Final implementation plan for SmartAGENT with all decisions locked in:\n\n- Model: Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Instruct Abliterated (uncensored)\n- Runtime: HuggingFace Transformers (Python-native, no Ollama)\n- Architecture: 3-layer hybrid (Static Analysis → AI Reasoning → RAG Knowledge Base)\n- CLI-first with Rich terminal output\n- 6-phase build plan with full project structure\n- Includes fine-tuning pipeline for later improvement\n\nReady for user approval to start building.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# SmartAGENT — Final Implementation Plan\n\n> **All decisions locked in. Ready to build.**\n\n---\n\n## Decisions Made\n\n| Decision | Choice |\n|----------|--------|\n| **Model** | `Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Instruct — Abliterated` |\n| **HuggingFace Repo** | `huihui-ai/Qwen2.5-Coder-3B-Instruct-abliterated` |\n| **Runtime** | HuggingFace Transformers (Python-native) |\n| **Parameters** | 3B (uncensored / no guardrails) |\n| **Context Window** | 128K tokens |\n| **VRAM** | 4–6 GB (float16) or ~2 GB (4-bit quantized) |\n| **License** | Apache 2.0 |\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"📁 Target Codebase\"] --> B[\"🔍 Layer 1: Static Scanners\"]\n    B --> |\"Flagged snippets + metadata\"| C[\"🧠 Layer 2: AI Judge\"]\n    D[\"📚 Layer 3: RAG Knowledge Base\"] --> |\"CVE/CWE/OWASP context\"| C\n    C --> E[\"📊 Vulnerability Report\"]\n\n    subgraph \"Static Scanners\"\n        B1[\"Secret Scanner\\n(API keys, tokens)\"]\n        B2[\"Dependency Scanner\\n(CVE lookup via OSV.dev)\"]\n        B3[\"Code Pattern Scanner\\n(Regex + Semgrep rules)\"]\n        B4[\"Config Scanner\\n(Dockerfiles, .env, CI)\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"AI Engine (HuggingFace Transformers)\"\n        C1[\"Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B\\nAbliterated\"]\n        C2[\"Chain-of-Thought\\nPrompting\"]\n        C3[\"Verify True/False\\nPositives\"]\n        C4[\"Generate Fix\\nSuggestions\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Knowledge Base\"\n        D1[\"ChromaDB\\nVector Store\"]\n        D2[\"CWE Descriptions\"]\n        D3[\"OWASP Top 10\"]\n        D4[\"CVE Advisories\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Output\"\n        E1[\"Terminal Report\\n(Rich tables)\"]\n        E2[\"JSON Export\"]\n        E3[\"HTML Report\"]\n        E4[\"Security Score\\n(A+ to F)\"]\n    end\n\n    B --> B1 & B2 & B3 & B4\n    C --> C1 & C2 & C3 & C4\n    D --> D1 & D2 & D3 & D4\n    E --> E1 & E2 & E3 & E4\n```\n\n---\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nsmartAGENT/\n├── pyproject.toml                 # Dependencies & project config\n├── README.md\n├── smartagent/\n│   ├── __init__.py\n│   ├── cli.py                     # Typer CLI (scan, report, config)\n│   ├── config.py                  # Settings & paths\n│   │\n│   ├── scanners/                  # Layer 1: Static Analysis\n│   │   ├── __init__.py\n│   │   ├── base.py                # Abstract scanner interface\n│   │   ├── secret_scanner.py      # Hardcoded secrets detection\n│   │   ├── dependency_scanner.py  # CVE lookup via OSV.dev API\n│   │   ├── pattern_scanner.py     # Regex-based vuln patterns\n│   │   └── config_scanner.py      # Dockerfile/.env misconfigs\n│   │\n│   ├── ai/                        # Layer 2: AI Reasoning\n│   │   ├── __init__.py\n│   │   ├── model.py               # HF Transformers model loader\n│   │   ├── prompts.py             # Security CoT prompt templates\n│   │   └── judge.py               # Verify findings + generate fixes\n│   │\n│   ├── knowledge/                 # Layer 3: RAG\n│   │   ├── __init__.py\n│   │   ├── vectorstore.py         # ChromaDB setup\n│   │   ├── ingest.py              # Ingest CWE/OWASP/CVE data\n│   │   └── retriever.py           # Retrieve relevant context\n│   │\n│   └── reporting/                 # Output\n│       ├── __init__.py\n│       ├── report.py              # Generate reports (terminal/JSON/HTML)\n│       └── scorer.py              # Security grade (A+ to F)\n│\n├── data/\n│   └── knowledge_base/            # CWE/OWASP/CVE documents\n│\n├── training/                      # Phase 6: Fine-tuning (later)\n│   ├── prepare_dataset.py\n│   ├── finetune.py\n│   └── evaluate.py\n│\n└── tests/\n    ├── test_scanners.py\n    ├── test_ai.py\n    └── vulnerable_samples/        # Known-vulnerable test code\n```\n\n---\n\n## Build Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Project Setup ⚡\n- `pyproject.toml` with all dependencies\n- Package structure, `__init__.py` files\n- Config management\n- CLI skeleton with `typer` + `rich`\n\n### Phase 2: Static Scanners 🔍\n- **Secret Scanner** — regex + entropy detection for API keys, passwords, tokens\n- **Dependency Scanner** — parse `requirements.txt`/`package.json` → query OSV.dev API for known CVEs\n- **Pattern Scanner** — regex rules for SQL injection, XSS, command injection, path traversal, etc.\n- **Config Scanner** — check Dockerfiles, .env files, CI configs for misconfigurations\n\n### Phase 3: AI Engine 🧠\n- Load `Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Abliterated` via HuggingFace Transformers\n- Support float16 (GPU) and 4-bit quantized (low VRAM)\n- Chain-of-Thought prompt templates for vulnerability reasoning\n- AI Judge: take static findings → verify true/false positive → assign severity → generate fix\n\n### Phase 4: RAG Knowledge Base 📚\n- ChromaDB vector store with `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` embeddings\n- Ingest CWE Top 25, OWASP Top 10, common CVE patterns\n- Retrieve relevant security context for each finding\n\n### Phase 5: Reporting 📊\n- Rich terminal output (colored tables, severity badges)\n- JSON export for CI/CD integration\n- HTML report with charts\n- Security score: A+ to F grade\n\n### Phase 6: Fine-Tuning (Later) 🎓\n- Prepare Big-Vul / Devign / D2A datasets\n- LoRA fine-tuning with `peft`\n- Benchmark against SARD/Juliet test suite\n\n---\n\n## Key Dependencies\n\n```\ntransformers>=4.45.0\ntorch>=2.0\naccelerate\nbitsandbytes          # 4-bit quantization\ntyper[all]            # CLI framework\nrich                  # Beautiful terminal output\nchromadb              # Vector store for RAG\nsentence-transformers # Embeddings\nrequests              # OSV.dev API calls\npyyaml                # Config files\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification Plan\n\n### Automated\n- `pytest tests/` — unit tests for all scanners\n- Scan known-vulnerable code samples (OWASP patterns)\n- Measure false positive rate on clean code\n\n### Manual\n- SmartAGENT scans its own codebase (dogfooding 🐕)\n- Compare results against Snyk/SonarQube\n\n---\n\n## Build Order\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    P1[\"Phase 1\\nSetup\\n~30 min\"] --> P2[\"Phase 2\\nScanners\\n~1 hr\"]\n    P2 --> P3[\"Phase 3\\nAI Engine\\n~1 hr\"]\n    P3 --> P4[\"Phase 4\\nRAG\\n~45 min\"]\n    P4 --> P5[\"Phase 5\\nReporting\\n~30 min\"]\n    P5 --> P6[\"Phase 6\\nFine-tune\\nLater\"]\n```\n\n---\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Approve this plan to start building!** I'll begin with Phase 1 (project setup) and work through all phases.\n","Description":"Final implementation plan for SmartAGENT with all decisions locked in — Qwen 2.5 Coder 3B Abliterated + HuggingFace Transformers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\k4ran\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa\\implementation_plan.md","toolAction":"Updating implementation plan","toolSummary":"Final implementation plan"}}]}
